272
00:19:20,342 --> 00:19:21,443
Sayang,

273
00:19:22,076 --> 00:19:26,304
aku akan terus bersamamu
sampai seseorang menjemputmu.

274
00:19:26,404 --> 00:19:28,142
-Mengerti?
-<i>Ya.</i>

275
00:19:28,675 --> 00:19:31,978
Kau sembunyi di mana sekarang?
Apa kau sudah menemukan tempat aman?

276
00:19:33,379 --> 00:19:34,432
<i>Aku di mobil.</i>

277
00:19:34,933 --> 00:19:37,812
Kau di dalam mobil,
bukan di luarnya, 'kan?

278
00:19:38,500 --> 00:19:39,405
<i>Ya.</i>

279
00:19:41,804 --> 00:19:46,068
Apa ada orang di dekatmu? Yang bisa
melihatmu, atau bisa berbicara padamu?

280
00:19:46,152 --> 00:19:47,033
<i>Tidak ada.</i>

281
00:19:47,413 --> 00:19:50,048
Baiklah, Sayang.

282
00:19:50,821 --> 00:19:52,703
Kau tadinya bersama siapa?

283
00:19:53,555 --> 00:19:54,540
<i>Seluruh keluargaku.</i>

284
00:19:55,349 --> 00:19:57,467
Siapa saja keluargamu?
Ada berapa orang?

285
00:19:57,784 --> 00:20:00,386
Kau tahu nama mereka?
Bisa beri tahu aku nama mereka?

286
00:20:01,103 --> 00:20:02,020
<i>Tidak.</i>

287
00:20:03,177 --> 00:20:04,819
Apa Ibu dan Ayah bersamamu?

288
00:20:05,027 --> 00:20:05,888
<i>Tidak.</i>

289
00:20:08,438 --> 00:20:12,614
Tentara menembakmu, ya, Sayang?

290
00:20:14,568 --> 00:20:17,147
Hanood, Sayang?

291
00:20:17,900 --> 00:20:19,333
<i>Cepatlah kemari!</i>

292
00:20:20,843 --> 00:20:24,466
Ya, Sayang, tenanglah. Dengarkan aku.

293
00:20:24,995 --> 00:20:25,872
Aku ingin...

294
00:20:27,129 --> 00:20:30,452
Aku akan menanyakan
beberapa pertanyaan padamu.

295
00:20:32,867 --> 00:20:34,280
-Hanood?
-<i>Ya?</i>

296
00:20:35,117 --> 00:20:36,931
Dengarkan aku.

297
00:20:38,592 --> 00:20:41,996
Ketika kau ditembaki

298
00:20:42,564 --> 00:20:43,818
kau sedang bersama siapa?

299
00:20:44,562 --> 00:20:46,064
-Ayahmu...
-<i>Seluruh keluargaku.</i>

300
00:20:46,512 --> 00:20:48,955
Kau bersama ayah dan ibumu di mobil?

301
00:20:49,543 --> 00:20:51,033
Atau di luar mobil?

302
00:20:51,381 --> 00:20:52,250
<i>Tidak.</i>

303
00:20:53,339 --> 00:20:55,029
<i>Ibuku belum meninggal.</i>

304
00:20:58,897 --> 00:21:00,498
Kau berapa bersaudara?

305
00:21:01,087 --> 00:21:02,388
<i>Aku hanya punya satu adik.</i>

306
00:21:03,061 --> 00:21:04,194
Berapa usianya?

307
00:21:05,243 --> 00:21:06,460
<i>Tiga tahun.</i>

308
00:21:07,681 --> 00:21:09,591
<i>Adikku di rumah bersama ibuku.</i>

309
00:21:09,872 --> 00:21:11,866
-Siapa nama adikmu?
-<i>Iyad.</i>

310
00:21:12,650 --> 00:21:14,472
-Zyad?
-<i>Ya.</i>

311
00:21:17,111 --> 00:21:19,473
-Nama kakakmu?
-<i>Aku tidak punya kakak.</i>

312
00:21:21,727 --> 00:21:23,257
Kau di mobil bersama siapa?

313
00:21:23,589 --> 00:21:24,586
<i>Sendirian.</i>

314
00:21:24,899 --> 00:21:26,208
-Kau sendirian?
-<i>Ya.</i>

315
00:21:30,056 --> 00:21:33,007
Kau sendirian di mobil sekarang?

316
00:21:33,800 --> 00:21:34,668
<i>Ya.</i>

317
00:21:36,378 --> 00:21:38,280
<i>Aku di sini tanpa keluargaku, ibuku</i>

318
00:21:39,009 --> 00:21:40,034
<i>ayahku</i>

319
00:21:40,819 --> 00:21:41,791
<i>adikku.</i>

320
00:21:44,174 --> 00:21:45,928
<i>Hanya ada kami dan Sarah.</i>

321
00:21:47,273 --> 00:21:49,083
Sarah? Di mana Sarah?

322
00:21:49,619 --> 00:21:50,881
<i>Sarah ada di sampingku.</i>

323
00:21:52,839 --> 00:21:54,544
<i>Kau sedang bersama Sarah?</i>

324
00:21:55,982 --> 00:21:56,903
Sarah...

325
00:21:58,092 --> 00:21:58,969
<i>Ya.</i>

326
00:22:03,189 --> 00:22:05,011
Hanood, Sayang

327
00:22:05,195 --> 00:22:08,118
apa Sarah yang tadi menelepon Paman?

328
00:22:08,406 --> 00:22:10,724
-Yang bicara padamu sebelumnya?
-<i>Bukan.</i>

329
00:22:12,822 --> 00:22:14,212
Apa Sarah bisa bicara?

330
00:22:14,877 --> 00:22:15,717
<i>Ya.</i>

331
00:22:21,139 --> 00:22:24,202
Apa Sarah terluka? Apa dia berdarah?

332
00:22:24,766 --> 00:22:25,860
<i>Dia berdarah.</i>

333
00:22:28,794 --> 00:22:31,789
